    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong><u>The Path of Blades</u></strong> <br><br><strong><i>A brutal, arcade-style dungeon crawler with modernized combat, Souls-like intensity, and retro-inspired visuals.</i></strong> <br><br>Enter the Dungeon. <span class=\"bb_strike\">Survive</span> the Unknown. You\u2019ve been thrown into a treacherous labyrinth where survival is instinct, and every decision is the difference between life and death. Navigate dark corridors, dodge deadly traps, and engage in visceral melee combat as you carve your way through this ever-hostile dungeon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Dungeon Crawling Reimagined</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-Person &amp; Third-Person Combat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dynamic Combat System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield an arsenal of melee weapons, dodge with i-frames, and use skillful timing to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Arcade Souls-Like Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Destructible Barrels &amp; Loot \u2013 Smash your way through the secondary environment to uncover hidden rewards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unforgiving Traps &amp; Ambushes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixelated Modern Aesthetic \u2013 A fusion of Doom-inspired retro pixelation with modern lighting and physics for a fresh but nostalgic experience. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <strong><u>The Path of Blades</u></strong> <br><br><strong><i>A brutal, arcade-style dungeon crawler with modernized combat, Souls-like intensity, and retro-inspired visuals.</i></strong> <br><br>Enter the Dungeon. <span class=\"bb_strike\">Survive</span> the Unknown. You\u2019ve been thrown into a treacherous labyrinth where survival is instinct, and every decision is the difference between life and death. Navigate dark corridors, dodge deadly traps, and engage in visceral melee combat as you carve your way through this ever-hostile dungeon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Dungeon Crawling Reimagined</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-Person &amp; Third-Person Combat </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dynamic Combat System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield an arsenal of melee weapons, dodge with i-frames, and use skillful timing to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Arcade Souls-Like Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Destructible Barrels &amp; Loot \u2013 Smash your way through the secondary environment to uncover hidden rewards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unforgiving Traps &amp; Ambushes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixelated Modern Aesthetic \u2013 A fusion of Doom-inspired retro pixelation with modern lighting and physics for a fresh but nostalgic experience. </p></li></ul>",
